{"id":"wb-5-396","name":"天台山伍龙寺","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"天台山伍龙寺","text":"天台山伍龙寺位于中国贵州省安顺市平坝县天龙镇，又称清净禅院，始建于明万历十八年（1590年），集佛寺、道观及军事堡垒于一体，2001年被列为第五批全国重点文物保护单位。\n天台山高约70米，三面绝壁，仅一面为陡坡。山顶伍龙寺，有山门、大佛殿、玉皇阁、关圣殿、祖师殿等建筑，整个建筑群的外墙紧贴悬崖而建。大佛殿面阔10.29米，进深8.42米，前廊顶上为鹤颈轩，轩梁下有“二十四孝”浮雕。玉皇阁面阔8.1米，进深5.48米，二层三檐歇山顶。关圣殿面阔12.9米，进深8.63米。祖师殿面阔12.44米。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%A4%A9%E5%8F%B0%E5%B1%B1%E4%BC%8D%E9%BE%99%E5%AF%BA","revisionId":93026385,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93026385","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/c495dbe67f0d2063fda085fd.jpg","title":"Pingba_Tiantai_Shan_Wulong_Si_2014.04.28_10-29-34.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Pingba_Tiantai_Shan_Wulong_Si_2014.04.28_10-29-34.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/81/Pingba_Tiantai_Shan_Wulong_Si_2014.04.28_10-29-34.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Zhangzhugang","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"平坝县天台山伍龙寺","width":320,"height":213}}